content.text:
The incident has two root causes, both reaching users through `frontend-proxy`. I've written up the findings below.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "shipping",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT service_name, message, time::VARCHAR AS t FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='shipping' AND message IN ('SIGTERM received; starting graceful shutdown','accept thread stopped') ORDER BY t", "claim": "Shipping received SIGTERM and stopped its accept thread at 09:19:50; no later shipping logs or spans appear."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='shipping' GROUP BY service_name", "claim": "Shipping emits zero spans in the incident window, versus normal quote traffic in the baseline."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='checkout' AND span_name='HTTP POST' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "All 9 of checkout's outgoing HTTP POST calls to shipping fail in about 1.4 ms with no child span."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "service": "frontend",
      "fault_kind": "dns_lookup_failed",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND (span_name LIKE '%ProductReviewService%' OR span_name='dns.lookup') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Frontend's ProductReviewService gRPC calls all fail in about 0.3 ms, alongside two frontend dns.lookup errors."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, duration/1e6 AS ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name='dns.lookup'", "claim": "Two frontend dns.lookup spans end in Error after about 1 ms, before any connection attempt."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "shipping",
      "to": "checkout",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='checkout' AND span_name IN ('HTTP POST','oteldemo.CheckoutService/PlaceOrder') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Checkout's shipping HTTP POST calls fail and PlaceOrder spans return Error in the same window."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "checkout",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name IN ('POST /api/checkout','grpc.oteldemo.CheckoutService/PlaceOrder') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Frontend's POST /api/checkout returns HTTP 500 and its PlaceOrder gRPC client spans fail."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "frontend",
      "to": "frontend-proxy",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend-proxy' AND span_name='ingress' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Frontend-proxy ingress returns HTTP 500 for user requests routed to frontend, with 26 error spans."}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

